<p><strong>Medical Disclaimer:</strong> This guide is for informational purposes only. Acupressure during pregnancy carries risks if contraindicated points are stimulated. Always consult your OB-GYN, midwife, or qualified healthcare provider before using acupressure during pregnancy. If you experience any unusual symptoms, stop immediately and seek medical attention.</p>
